        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Hell is Born is a single player, third person, horror style, open map game where the player gets stranded while on a road trip in a foggy town and must collect 6 gas cans in order to escape. Creatures roam the area unpredictably and can hear the player run or will attack when the player is seen. Hide from enemies in bushes. Throw empty bottles as a distraction. Find collectibles. Unlock secret weapons. All while staying alive. No saves. No checkpoints. Will you collect all the gas cans and escape? Or become lost in a world that's long been forgotten?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where Hell is Born is a single player, third person, horror style, open map game where the player gets stranded while on a road trip in a foggy town and must collect 6 gas cans in order to escape. Creatures roam the area unpredictably and can hear the player run or will attack when the player is seen. Hide from enemies in bushes. Throw empty bottles as a distraction. Find collectibles. Unlock secret weapons. All while staying alive. No saves. No checkpoints. Will you collect all the gas cans and escape? Or become lost in a world that's long been forgotten?</p>",
